1
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:11,760
Huang,

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:13,160
don't.

3
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,490
Where are you going?

4
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,980
Where is the USB drive?

5
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:16,900
I don't have it.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,460
What are you doing?

7
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:20,500
Weiwei,

8
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:21,650
leave me and run!

9
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,170
You know each other?

10
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,600
Huang Xinze.

11
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,050
Don't touch her.

12
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:31,860
I'm telling you...

13
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,700
Take them away.

14
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:37,250
Don't

15
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:37,680
move.

16
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,560
Do you know this is illegal?

17
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:40,920
Wait.

18
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,260
Take them away.

19
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,440
Slow down.

20
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,760
Cute, right?

21
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,220
Matches your clothes.

22
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,960
They're our sister company.

23
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:12,440
I really envy you.

24
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:13,680
Envy me

25
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:14,650
for what?

26
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,320
That your parents are so open-minded,

27
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,650
unlike my stubborn mom.

28
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,200
Now I get scared whenever she calls.

29
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,280
If it weren't for work,

30
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:24,140
I'd put my phone on Do Not Disturb.

31
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,360
Hearing your situation,

32
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,020
I thought of a solution today.

33
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,180
What solution?

34
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:31,620
If it works,

35
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,520
I'll buy you milk tea for a week.

36
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,380
How about that?

37
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,440
Milk tea isn't enough.

38
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,300
Call me bro.

39
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,720
You're taking advantage of me, aren't you?

40
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,880
I found her a volunteer job

41
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,720
at the welfare home.

42
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,360
Welfare home?

43
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:49,890
To the welfare home?

44
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:51,640
What's wrong?

45
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,160
Hurry back to the apartment to meet me.

46
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,960
Something happened to Fang Wei.

47
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:56,729
Let's go.

48
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Right now.

49
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,680
Hello, Prosecutor Qiao.

50
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:04,080
Something might have happened to Fang Wei.

51
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:09,860
Go down.

52
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,720
What happened to Wei?

53
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,460
Wei might be in danger.

54
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,890
But I've already notified Captain Zheng.

55
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:30,560
Hello, ma'am.

56
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:31,600
Yishan,

57
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:34,120
Wei was just taking her uncle
to turn himself in.

58
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,400
It seems

59
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,160
to be about some flash drive.

60
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,680
Her uncle ran away.

61
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,740
Wei went after him.

62
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:39,560
I...

63
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:40,720
Please don't panic.

64
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,160
I understand the situation.

65
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,160
Just wait at home.

66
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,740
Don't go anywhere.

67
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,490
Take it easy.

68
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:50,800
Huang,

69
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:51,540
I was wrong.

70
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,050
Stop hitting me.

71
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,360
You've got some nerve,

72
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,400
daring to trick me.

73
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,240
I was wrong.

74
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,330
You sent a location to the suburbs.

75
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:02,840
This thing is so light,

76
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,600
it must be fake too.

77
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,200
It's fake.

78
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,000
You big liar.

79
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,360
I was wrong,

80
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:06,960
Huang.

81
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,560
Where is the flash drive?

82
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:09,960
I don't

83
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,800
know where it is either.

84
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,640
Did you drop it

85
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:13,880
when you caught me?

86
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:14,540
Keep making

87
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,440
things up.

88
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:15,640
Huang,

89
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,680
stop hitting me.

90
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,000
Keep making things up.

91
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,480
I was wrong.

92
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,810
Stop hitting me, Huang.

93
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:20,680
Let go.

94
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,079
Huang,

95
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:21,800
stop hitting me.

96
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,200
Huang,

97
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,720
I was wrong.

98
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,660
Let's be honest, okay?

99
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,480
Do you think I'm an idiot?

100
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,530
Huang Xinze.

101
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,850
I'm telling you,

102
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,260
you can't get away.

103
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:32,860
Weiwei,

104
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,640
how can you

105
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,329
talk to Huang like that?

106
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,079
Huang.

107
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,760
The little girl doesn't know any better.

108
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,000
This has nothing to do with her.

109
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,860
Don't hold it against her, Huang.

110
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,079
You're that prosecutor, right?

111
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,420
Your niece?

112
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,560
No, no.

113
00:03:49,079 --> 00:03:51,120
You kidnapped us in the residential area.

114
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,800
There are surveillance cameras
everywhere outside now.

115
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,400
The police will be here soon.

116
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,460
I advise you to stop while you can.

117
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,079
Stop?

118
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,580
She's advising us to stop.

119
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,480
We've done so much,

120
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:08,380
and you're telling me to stop?

121
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,440
Are you kidding me?

122
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,399
Stop hitting me.

123
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:16,880
Huang,

124
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:17,779
I was wrong.

125
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,120
Where is the flash drive?

126
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,360
Tell me right now,

127
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,880
or I'll kill you.

128
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,320
If you push me,

129
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,960
I'll do anything.

130
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:29,600
Huang,

131
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:32,240
I really don't know
where the flash drive is.

132
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,240
Stop hitting him.

133
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,170
Stop hitting me.

134
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,380
I'll ask you one last time.

135
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,659
Still not talking?

136
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,720
I'll talk.

137
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:42,540
Zhang Qing,

138
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,530
don't say it.

139
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,730
He wouldn't dare do anything to us.

140
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,760
Still acting tough, huh?

141
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,290
I'm telling you,

142
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,659
you're a woman,

143
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,360
so I won't hit you.

144
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,380
Why are you hitting me?

145
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,160
Then I'll kill you first.

146
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,520
No, no, no,

147
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:03,920
Huang.

148
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,480
I'll talk.

149
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,610
I'll tell you where the flash drive is.

150
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,480
Keep talking.

151
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,220
I'll take you to get it.

152
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,460
Are you fooling me?

153
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,120
Learn how to trick people from our team,

154
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,760
will you?

155
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,290
Call someone

156
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,650
to bring it over.

157
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,760
Only one person can come.

158
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,810
Try calling the cops

159
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:34,159
and see what happens.

160
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:49,640
Hello?

161
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,250
Are you busy?

162
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,140
I'm at home.

163
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,680
What's wrong?

164
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,600
Do you need something this late?

165
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:00,200
Do you remember my USB drive?

166
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,090
Yes, I do.

167
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,080
What about it?

168
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,530
Get to the point.

169
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,680
Stop stalling.

170
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,540
I need it urgently.

171
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,760
Can you bring it over?

172
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,400
I'll send you the address in a bit.

173
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,480
Come alone.

174
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:17,690
It's urgent.

175
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:18,680
Got it.

176
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,170
Send me the address.

177
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,220
Captain Zheng,

178
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,480
This area is wide open

179
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,800
with a clear view.

180
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,260
If too many of us go,

181
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,800
we'll easily be spotted,

182
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,330
putting Fang Wei in danger.

183
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,659
Prosecutor Xu,

184
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,280
how many people do you think they have?

185
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,010
I'm not sure.

186
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,020
But judging from the call,

187
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,280
there are quite a few.

188
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,760
We need to think of a plan.

189
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,280
They've already demanded

190
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,159
that I go alone.

191
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,370
You can't go.

192
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,820
You're still sick.

193
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:58,840
I'm the only guy

194
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,960
in the whole office.

195
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:00,490
Let me go.

196
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,850
You're not going anywhere.

197
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,020
Didn't you hear

198
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,600
them call her 'sister'?

199
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,980
If anyone's going,

200
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,280
it should be me.

201
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,160
You can't go.

202
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,360
Why can't I?

203
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,420
Calm down, you two.

204
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:15,060
I spent a year on exchange
in the police force

205
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,720
and have some
criminal investigation experience.

206
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,250
Let me go.

207
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,690
For the rest,

208
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,530
we'll listen to Captain Zheng.

209
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,860
Glad you're sensible.

210
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,660
I brought the stuff to you.

211
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,560
Let him go,

212
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,120
and I'll be your hostage.

213
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,360
Dealing with two people
is too much trouble.

214
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,159
What nonsense are you talking about?

215
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:35,560
Fine.

216
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,680
Then I'll kill him

217
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,800
so I don't have to take an extra person.

218
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,800
You're dreaming.

219
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:42,140
I'm not letting him go.

220
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,140
You're even afraid of a woman.

221
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,860
How can you achieve anything?

222
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:48,680
No wonder Cui Xiangqin and Cheng Jia
played you for a fool.

223
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:51,080
Their fund accounts are completely clean.

224
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,560
You're just a scapegoat.

225
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,890
Don't you feel wronged?

226
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,680
Women.

227
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,480
None of you women are any good.

228
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:01,600
Mr. Huang

229
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:03,770
Huang

230
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,360
Stop it! Stop!

231
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,080
A woman ruined you.

232
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,160
Why are you hitting me?

233
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,400
You feel wronged?

234
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,580
I'm more wronged than you are!

235
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,000
Stop it, Huang Xinze!

236
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,600
I'm a prosecutor.

237
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,640
I know how to resolve this.

238
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:35,159
Women.

239
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,690
I will never trust women again.

240
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,610
The money I worked my whole life for

241
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:44,320
was taken by two women.

242
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:50,010
Do you know what's in that flash drive?

243
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,760
It's money.

244
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:52,840
Money!

245
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,970
All of Mingjinbao's money is in there.

246
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,800
That's over a billion.

247
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,480
A billion!

248
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,680
I only got 300,000.

249
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,280
Women

250
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,160
are so vicious.

251
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:17,520
She secretly took all my money

252
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,330
and wanted to leave it to her daughter.

253
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,560
In her dreams!

254
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,520
How do you know this money

255
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,120
was left for her daughter?

256
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,080
Of course I know.

257
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:33,080
Cui Xiangqin kept clamoring
to break up the partnership.

258
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,880
Then she suddenly died.

259
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:37,340
And the flash drive disappeared.

260
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,690
I knew things weren't that simple.

261
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,280
Right?

262
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:41,400
Isn't it?

263
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,610
Sure enough,

264
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:45,040
her daughter had the flash drive.

265
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,360
Do you have proof?

266
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:48,000
You've been in control

267
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,800
of Mingjinbao's account funds.

268
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:51,600
Control

269
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,880
my ass.

270
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,210
You were right about one thing.

271
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:02,160
I'm just a scapegoat.

272
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,520
She secretly changed the encryption key

273
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:07,320
and linked Mingjinbao's crypto wallet

274
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,400
to her own name.

275
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,680
If that's not proof, what is?

276
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:15,800
Boss,

277
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:16,860
someone's coming.

278
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:24,680
Go check

279
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,960
if they're alone.

280
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:39,920
Follow me.

281
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:08,360
Wei!

282
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:10,410
I brought the stuff.

283
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,040
Who are you?

284
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:19,920
Thanks for your trouble.

285
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,560
Never mind who we are.

286
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,360
Just hand it over.

287
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,010
Is she alone?

288
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,600
Bring it here.

289
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,200
Let them go first.

290
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,520
Use your brain.

291
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,400
Look who's in charge here.

292
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:53,010
You got what you wanted.

293
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:53,980
Let them go.

294
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,000
How do I know if this is real?

295
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,460
Zhang Qing,

296
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,880
see if this is the one you got.

297
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:03,490
Yes, yes.

298
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,160
This is it.

299
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,800
You're not lying to me this time, are you?

300
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,200
Huang,

301
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,200
