302
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,660
How could I dare lie to you?

303
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,410
Boss.

304
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:18,410
Let's go.

305
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,690
We've got the stuff.

306
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:22,120
Let's leave before anything else happens.

307
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:27,920
Women,

308
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,120
you women

309
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,200
are so despicable.

310
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,560
Weiwei.

311
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:36,360
Police!

312
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:38,000
Freeze and get down!

313
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,600
Get down!

314
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:43,480
Uncle!

315
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,140
Weiwei.

316
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,300
You finally

317
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,850
called me uncle.

318
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:51,640
Put it down!

319
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:52,700
Don't move!

320
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:53,580
Weiwei.

321
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:07,200
Don't cry.

322
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:10,640
It's okay.

323
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:13,200
This little scratch is nothing.

324
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:14,440
You see,

325
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,040
I was

326
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:16,650
so brave back there.

327
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,380
I beat the crap out of them.

328
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,420
They got way more injuries

329
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:23,560
than I did.

330
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:25,320
Alright,

331
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,120
give it a rest.

332
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:30,570
You're still joking around in this state.

333
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,100
Let me tell you,

334
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,100
this injury...

335
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,370
What do you mean?

336
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,160
Weiwei

337
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:39,480
called

338
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:40,240
me

339
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,040
uncle.

340
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,320
Really?

341
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:44,760
Of course.

342
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,320
What happened?

343
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:48,240
Tell me.

344
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:49,560
That day

345
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,600
at the scene,

346
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,480
my actions

347
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:55,360
moved her to tears.

348
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:57,660
She said

349
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:58,880
she feels safe

350
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:00,540
with me around.

351
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,060
She also

352
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:03,500
called me her big hero.

353
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:05,640
She forgave me.

354
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:06,840
She...

355
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,530
Did she really say that?

356
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:10,480
Weiwei said all that?

357
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,640
I never said those things.

358
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,240
Just admit it.

359
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,840
What's there to be shy about?

360
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:19,560
Weiwei,

361
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,440
you and your uncle...

362
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:23,800
It's all in the past.

363
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:25,130
Let's not talk about it.

364
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,320
Let's not talk about it.

365
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,650
Let's not talk about it.

366
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,650
When your uncle is discharged,

367
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,200
let's go have a nice meal.

368
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:33,720
No, sis.

369
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:37,800
Why eat out?

370
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,970
You know my cooking skills.

371
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,880
I have to cook something delicious

372
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:42,520
myself,

373
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:43,720
so Weiwei

374
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,280
can taste my cooking.

375
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:46,640
Give me a break.

376
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:47,700
In your condition,

377
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,500
just focus on recovering.

378
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:52,690
The police will question you
in a few days.

379
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:53,960
Don't hide anything,

380
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:54,560
got it?

381
00:14:56,680 --> 00:14:57,840
My case isn't closed yet.

382
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,640
I'm heading back to work in a bit.

383
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:00,060
Mom.

384
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:02,000
Call me if you need anything.

385
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Keep an eye on him.

386
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,200
Don't let him run off.

387
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:06,970
Let's go.

388
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,610
Based on the current clues,

389
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,080
Cui Xiangqin's death

390
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:46,280
should be a self-directed scam.

391
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:48,220
She wanted to use her death

392
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:50,200
to divert everyone's attention

393
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:53,730
and transfer the stolen money
from Mingjinbao to her daughter.

394
00:15:56,960 --> 00:16:00,220
I often wake up suddenly
in the middle of the night recently

395
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,410
and cough up a lot of bloody sputum.

396
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:03,440
Dr. Yang,

397
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,680
what is wrong with me?

398
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,100
Judging from the test report,

399
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,280
the situation is still not very good.

400
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:10,080
Director Cui,

401
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:11,880
the current medical treatment

402
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,680
has a relatively limited effect

403
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,760
on relieving the symptoms.

404
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:17,970
Just tell me.

405
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,840
I can take it.

406
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:20,820
Well...

407
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,330
I'll prepare

408
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,760
a few more treatment plans for you first

409
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:27,480
to see if we can suppress
the cause of the disease.

410
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:27,920
But...

411
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:29,120
To be honest,

412
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,880
I'm really not completely sure.

413
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:33,160
So,

414
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,960
do you want to find
a few more doctors to take a look?

415
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:38,500
Then...

416
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:40,600
What if I go abroad for this disease?

417
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:41,810
Will they have a way?

418
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,160
It's hard to say.

419
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:44,620
Academically,

420
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,880
we are all connected.

421
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,570
But you can give it a try.

422
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,000
How

423
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,080
did we get targeted
by the regulatory authorities?

424
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,080
Didn't you say our

425
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,520
cryptocurrency trading was very safe?

426
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,000
I didn't expect

427
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,400
the regulatory authorities
to react so quickly either.

428
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,800
But don't worry, Mr. Cui.

429
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,800
I've already handled

430
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,200
what needs to be handled.

431
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,280
It should take them some time

432
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:09,280
to find evidence.

433
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,819
Stop immediately.

434
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:15,300
We can't continue.

435
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:18,119
No

436
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,680
way.

437
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:22,839
We have such good momentum right now.

438
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:24,440
How can we just stop?

439
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,319
Besides,

440
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:27,930
we've already invested so much money.

441
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,040
What should we do?

442
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:32,800
You really care more
about money than your life.

443
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,360
Do you know how serious this is?

444
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:35,560
It means prison time.

445
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,700
Even rotting in jail won't be enough.

446
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,960
Fortune favors the bold.

447
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,800
If you don't take a gamble,

448
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:47,880
how will you know if we can make it big?

449
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:48,760
Besides,

450
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,440
we're talking about over a billion.

451
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,440
This little risk

452
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:53,900
is nothing.

453
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:05,300
Tell me,

454
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:07,520
what's your plan?

455
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:12,960
We'll work until the end of the year.

456
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,890
Before we leave,

457
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,260
let's make a big score.

458
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:20,820
There's no room for negotiation.

459
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:44,000
You know everything.

460
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,040
You framed Cheng Jia

461
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,960
to buy time,

462
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:51,040
so you could safely deliver the USB drive
containing 1.06 billion in stolen money

463
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:52,200
to your daughter.

464
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,400
You planned every step,

465
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:57,580
including your own death.

466
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:03,240
I had no choice.

467
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,260
But my daughter is different.

468
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,520
As a mother,

469
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,610
I don't think I did anything wrong.

470
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,280
Nothing wrong?

471
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:17,010
Was it not wrong to frame Cheng Jia
for your own death?

472
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:19,800
How many families were destroyed
by that 1.06 billion?

473
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,280
Are you saying you did nothing wrong?

474
00:19:21,280 --> 00:19:23,600
What you did can't even
be described as a mistake.

475
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:24,640
It's inhumane

476
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,500
and completely crosses the line.

477
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:30,960
I just wanted my daughter

478
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,400
to live a happy

479
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,680
and carefree life.

480
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:36,840
From the moment you chose
the path of crime,

481
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:40,090
she was destined to never be carefree.

482
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:43,170
I never told my daughter anything.

483
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:45,100
She knows nothing.

484
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:48,080
The truth will come to light one day.

485
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,280
She will know everything.
